      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-309445",
      ":question/problem": "Dataset $H$ consists of $39$ integers between $300$ and $700$. Dataset $J$ consists of all the integers in $H$ together with the additional integer $100$. Which of the following statements is true?\n\n1. The mean must be less for dataset $J$ than for dataset $H$.\n2. The median must be less for dataset $J$ than for dataset $H$.\n3. The mean might not be less for dataset $J$ than for dataset $H$.\n4. The median might not be less for dataset $J$ than for dataset $H$."
