      ":question/problem": "Dataset $M$ consists of $52$ integers between $20$ and $60$. Dataset $N$ consists of all the integers in $M$ together with the additional integer $500$. Which of the following statements is true?\n\n1. The mean must be greater for dataset $N$ than for dataset $M$.\n2. The median must be greater for dataset $N$ than for dataset $M$.\n3. The mean might not be greater for dataset $N$ than for dataset $M$.\n4. The median might not be greater for dataset $N$ than for dataset $M$."
